<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700 sm:text-lg">Populate and work with one-dimensional and two-dimensional arrays. Each input represents an indexed array element.</p>
<details class="example-menu mt-5">
    <summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer py-2 font-semibold">Examples on this page</summary>
